#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:38
msgid "For changing the element collection paths of QElectroTech:"
msgstr "要更改 QElectroTech 的元件集合路径："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:40
#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:57
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech 设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:41
#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:58
msgid "Go to **Elements** section."
msgstr "转到 **元件** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:42
msgid ""
"Search and choose the folder directory from the `QET (Common)`_ and `User`_ "
"element collection at the **Collection of elements** section."
msgstr ""
"在 **元件集合** 部分中，搜索并选择 `QET（通用） <QET (Common)_>`_ 和 `用户 <User_>`_ "
"元件集合所在的文件夹目录。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:43
#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:60
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close settings "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改并关闭设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:47
msgid "QElectroTech has to be restarted to implement the changes."
msgstr "必须重新启动 QElectroTech，更改才会生效。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:50
msgid "Element management settings"
msgstr "元件管理设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:52
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the possibility to predefine the `element author`_. In"
" this way; when a new `element`_ is created, QElectroTech defines "
"automatically this `element property`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了预先定义 `元件作者 <element author_>`_ 的功能。这样，当创建新的 `元件 <element_>`_"
" 时，QElectroTech 会自动定义该 `元件属性 <element property_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:55
msgid "For pre-defining the `element author`_ information:"
msgstr "要预定义 `元件作者 <element author_>`_ 信息："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:59
msgid ""
"Defines the element author and license information at the text box from "
"**Elements management** section."
msgstr "在 **元件管理** 部分的文本框中定义元件作者和许可信息。"
